  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Equation of bisectors of lines $x y=0$ are $y=\\pm x$ \nput $y=\\pm x$ in $m y^2+\\left(1-m^2\\right) x y-m x^2=0$, we get $\\left(1-m^2\\right) x^2=0$ \n$\\Rightarrow m=\\pm 1$.",
    "image": null
  },
